  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC 70th CCE Marks 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-07-22T14:20:03+05:30\">July 22, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:20 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Marks </strong>on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Bihar BPSC 70th CCE Mains Examination 2026</strong>. The Interview will be start from <strong data-end=\"175\" data-start=\"135\">21 January 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"230\">17th March 2025</strong>. Candidates can Download their <strong>Marks</strong>\u00a0using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">BPSC 70th CCE Marks 2026 \u2013 Out</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC 70th CCE Pre Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bpsc-70th-cce-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date <b>: 28 September 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Application Last Date <b>: 04 November 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date <strong>:</strong> <strong>04</strong><b>\u00a0November 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">Pre Exam Date</span><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"> :</span></strong></span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"> 13th December, 2024</span></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">New Exam Date<strong> : 04 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available\u00a0<b>: 27 December 2024</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key Date : <strong>08 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Final Answer Key : <strong>17 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">OMR Sheet Date : <strong>19-21 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Result Declared Date : <strong>23 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Mains Exam From :-</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>21 February 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply last Date: <strong>17 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Exam Date : <strong>25, 26, 28, 29 &amp; 30 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>12 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Result : <strong>16 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">DV Schedule : <strong>29 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">DV Last Date : <strong>17 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Interview Start Date : 21 January 2026 \u2013 28 February 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Interview Letter :<strong> 15 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Final Result : <strong>20 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Marks : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22 July 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General</strong>, <strong>EWS,</strong> <strong>OBC</strong>,: <strong>\u20b9600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Other State : <strong>\u20b9600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC</strong>, <strong>ST</strong>, <strong>PH Of Bihar</strong> : <strong>\u20b9150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Female Of Bihar : \u20b9150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BPSC 70th CCE Recruitment 2024 : Age Limits As On 30 September 2024</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>42 years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BPSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <b>70th CCE Pre Exam</b>\u00a0position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">2035 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagea