span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> Who releases the <strong>BPSC 70th CCE Final Result 2026?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The <strong data-end=\"204\" data-start=\"162\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</strong> releases the Final Result.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> For which exam is this <strong>Final Result released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer: It is released for the <strong data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"324\">70th Combined Competitive Examination (CCE)</strong>.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When is the Final Result<strong>\u00a0usually released?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li data-end=\"608\" data-start=\"584\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">It is released <strong data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"644\">after the declaration of the mains <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">interview schedule</span></strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> How can candidates check their <strong>Final Result?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>Candidates can view it by downloading the Final Result from the <strong>BPSC website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>BPSC</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>BPSC </strong></span>is <strong>https://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"BPSC 70th CCE Final Result 2026\" class=\"size-full wp-image-36928 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BPSC-70th-CCE-Final-Result-2026.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BPSC-70th-CCE-Final-Result-2026.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BPSC-70th-CCE-Final-Result-2026-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BPSC-70th-CCE-Final-Result-2026-768x432.jpg 768w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"